<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Caney, Kan. yields 6.40 pct.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Caney, Kan. yields 6.40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel Nicolaus &amp; Co Inc said it priced $1.110 million of Caney, Kan., industrial revenue (Kopco Inc) bonds, Series A 1996, with a top yield of 6.40 percent in 2008.</p>
</text>
